{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le17ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le17ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "While this, my new movie, is being made, my team has been thanked daily. Any director who is being supported by a strong production team should realize that they are beyond lucky. If they have ever been helped by as many other highly creative people as I have, they should acknowledge that their jobs have been made far easier. When they are being recognized, they are happy and appreciative.", "time": "050", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img03.jpg", "text": "<br />This was the most important lesson I learned on my first film. That knowledge has helped me ever since. We have had some really complicated sets this time around. They could have caused problems. I was very confident, and saw every problem as a challenge to be overcome.<br /><br />In the past I would have carefully arranged the indoor scenes. I used to keep an eye on the costumes being designed to make sure that everything was perfect.", "time": "27500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn9le17ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<br />I would hold auditions that included both cold readings and improvisations. I used to make sure I had more than enough time to choose the best actors for the job. I used to do too much. Then I started to let everyone do what they came to do. I have never looked back.<br /><br />Today on set the actors have been left to me. The other work is being done by those I have come to trust and rely on. We've watched the rushes daily. They haven't  disappointed us, so we continue.  I'm glad I learned my lesson early. So are the others who work with me.", "time": "57000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about film and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about habits in the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what is being done or what has been done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Have you ever wanted to work in the movies? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "How usual or rare is it to work in the movies in your country?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Making movies is hard work!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " They're <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">holding</span> auditions for the movie today!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "